---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Write to AI Spanda about an idea, question, or reusable-asset note. Nothing for sale — personal thought leadership only.">
  <header class="page-hero shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>Write with a clear question.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Share what you are trying to understand or make possible, and the constraint that matters most. This is a personal blog contact path — not a sales funnel.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 1rem">
    <div class="shell contact-panel">
      <div class="contact-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A helpful message includes</p><h2>Outcome. Context. Constraint.</h2><p>What should become clearer? Who is affected? What currently makes it difficult? Do not send sensitive or confidential information by ordinary email.</p></div>
      <div class="contact-details"><p class="eyebrow">Email</p><h2 style="font-size: 2.3rem">Write to AI Spanda</h2><p><a href="mailto:rajeevkasatai@gmail.com">rajeevkasatai@gmail.com</a></p><p>Include “AI Spanda” in the subject so the context is clear.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
